    "title": "Dual-Mode Scheduled Transactions System",
    "type": "architecture",
    "context": {
      "what": "Implemented a system for both fully automatic (Netflix) and semi-automated (Rent) transactions.",
      "why": "To provide flexibility between silent processing and manual approval workflows.",
      "where": "SchedulerService.ts, schema.ts, types.ts, app/scheduled-transactions.tsx",
      "learned": "Using a single table with a 'SCHEDULED' template status is efficient. Semi-automated ones create a 'DUE' instance. Integration with expo-notifications ensures user feedback on background processes."
    },
